&+CAll aboard&n
&+Y-&n &+MThe Stromvok&n now runs its route from Storm Port to Torrhan to Strathor and
  back around. Passage costs &+Y10 platinum&n; it waits &+Y3 minutes&n at each stop
  and advances every &+Y2 seconds&n while underway.
&+Y-&n &+C'look out'&n works throughout the ferries without moving you out of your
  room or disturbing a wand you are using. WaveDancer's hold and cabins now
  enforce tickets and support announcements, looking out and disembarking
  like its other rooms.
&+Y-&n Ferry removal during a full reset no longer leaves the route pointing at a
  missing vessel. If a ferry must be removed, its passengers are returned
