  the mount moved first. This repairs gates in
  &+LThe &+rSc&+Ro&+Yrc&+Rh&+red&+L Valley&n, &+gGhore&n,
  &+bBraddistock &+WMansion&n, The &+LShadow &+gForest&n, the Clawed Caverns,
  &+wVillage of &+ySplit Shield&n, &+CJotunheim&n and &+gVerzanan&n.
