  now unlock at &+Ylevel 20&n instead of &+Ylevel 30&n. Existing ship owners
  receive &+Y100 platinum&n instead.
&+Y-&n Hull purchases now accept colored ship names by visible length. Names may
  contain up to &+Y20 visible characters&n without color codes exhausting the
  purchase buffer.
&+Y-&n The interactive &+CPower Atlas&n now includes all &+Y56&n legal Human and Orc
  multiclass pairings, compared at levels &+Y21&n, &+Y31&n, &+Y46&n,
  &+Y50&n and &+Y56&n. Browse it at:
  &+Chttps://luminarimud.github.io/Duris/power-atlas/&n

&+CLogin, clients and everyday stability&n
&+Y-&n Login and reconnect are more resilient: a temporary problem loading
  optional belongings, pets, bank data or history no longer strands an
  otherwise valid character. Unresolved state stays protected from overwrite.
&+Y-&n GMCP on/off feedback now matches the setting you chose, character-level
  opt-out applies to broadcast channels, and an empty prompt no longer leaves
  a stale prompt pending in supporting clients.
&+Y-&n Waking now returns you to a consistent resting posture. If an old mixed
  standing/resting state appears, &+C'rest'&n or &+C'stand'&n repairs it cleanly.
&+Y-&n Racewar side-change cooldowns are now enforced consistently during native
