&+L- The guild system has been restructured.
&+L  Basically it is more advanced, you build your guild based on
&+L  guild prestige points. Can become a kingdom and war other
&+L  guilds and much more. Help file coming as soon as possible!

&+L- Experience has been changed some.&n
  &+WPVP &+rkills &+Lare actually worth it now, &+Whappy &+rhunting&+L!&n

&+L- Zone trophy system. Which means that the trophy is calculated
&+L  on how much exp you have gained in the zone, opposed to how
&+L  many mobs you have killed.

&+L- Experience is now split among the group, so the bigger the
&+L  group is the less exp you get from each kill. But the smaller
&+L  the group is the faster you trophy out on mobs and have to
&+L  move around more.&n

&+L* &+rEvil &+Lexperience group cap = &+W4&n
&+L* &+GGood &+Lexperience group cap = &+W8&n

&+L- Class specs are more restricted.
&+L  Basically there are more restrictions in which class/spec the
&+L  different races can become. This is to create diversity in
&+L  what race/class combinations people play. Some spec spells
&+L  have also been re-arranged. Type help speclist in game.&n

